{"title":"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The consecutive angles of a trapezoid form an arithmetic sequence. If the smallest angle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/d/dedd77d029c19ec5ed32b0f5b1275ad02b22b1ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75^\\circ$\" width=\"24\" height=\"13\" />, then the largest angle is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/b/81be75290825e1434e0cff9b064a9fa572c954b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } 95^\\circ\\quad \\text{(B) } 100^\\circ\\quad \\text{(C) } 105^\\circ\\quad \\text{(D) } 110^\\circ\\quad \\text{(E) } 115^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"382\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since a trapezoid is a quadrilateral, its interior angles sum to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/9/cf9506d61661a7d046ee93b381ddb704684ffd15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$360^\\circ$\" width=\"33\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> be the common difference of the arithmetic sequence.  Then the trapezoid's angle measures, in degrees, are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/d/43d3c0c8b06e5ee2a54983daeb03b63e4bf0a1d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75, 75+d, 75+2d, 75+3d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"212\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/0/f004fe0ab5924407a077b5488e861839b4124f29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$300+6d=360$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"121\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/f/48f49c25bebad7fde170b47bef3a86c188ed2c0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"51\" height=\"13\" />. Thus the largest angle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0d753284fb0435dcef569bf78df691e2fc8c8bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75 + 3 \\cdot 10 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 105^\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"187\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Like in all quadrilaterals, the interior angles of a trapezoid sum to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/9/cf9506d61661a7d046ee93b381ddb704684ffd15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$360^\\circ$\" width=\"33\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>Recall that the sum of an arithmetic sequence with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> terms, first term <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/b/1ab39d761413804680d26d972381f028001562f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" />, and last term <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/1/6f1a2b6b7c193f9ba2b2134a59f1da5addcfbc98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/1/16120fea1c3cd9c269959cc552971e57146e25bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n}{2}(a_1 + a_n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"89\" height=\"34\" />.  Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/1/5218af40079081e694d8b82eeac2d368ef6ea76a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/8/4d8bbe58de787ca12526f275e68dc008ba91de7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1 = 75^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"69\" height=\"18\" /> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/1/891d3737f99aae2563adc76dddb24b0d19362936.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4}{2}(75^\\circ + a_4) = 360^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"153\" height=\"38\" />, and solving this equation yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce598a8b3aec0486ce57d83794759c2517694350.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_4 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 105^\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"124\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME\" title=\"1990 AHSME\">1990 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1990 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1990\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"e